{"server":"tw","storyId":"act12side_level_act12side_st04","groupId":"act12side","stageId":"act12side_st04","title":"海浪照常拍岸","storyCode":"DH-ST-4","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_st04.txt","sourceHash":"4a4d6aef4ae2ef2d6eeaee3dd2059b21d0ee466e9bb63a0dcc7ff4b2ef4f0f1a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"危機結束，夏日還在繼續。而每個參與其中的人都有各自的思緒。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"經紀人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你終於醒了，D.D.D.。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，睡完覺醒過來不是很正常的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"經紀人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但你昨天回來之後倒頭就睡，搞得我有點害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"......現在外面是什麼情況？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"經紀人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是問城裡的狀況的話，和之前沒什麼差別，一樣的喧鬧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"經紀人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我去吃早飯的時候聽到很多人在討論昨天的事，但是他們也都不怎麼在乎的感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟事情已經被沖淡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"坎黛拉市長真是個厲害人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"在昨天那種情況下，居然會用那樣的方式......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"經紀人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我當時在電視前也震驚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"經紀人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那種鎮場的方式，真的是聞所未聞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"經紀人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且還真的有不少人去和那些危險分子戰鬥了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"我當時就在旁邊，那種感覺，真是太奇妙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"坎黛拉女士的不遠處，是想要拼命衝過來殺掉她的危險分子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"而坎黛拉女士對此卻不屑一顧，她只關心無人機有沒有靠近遊輪，能否看到船上的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"她就站在那裡，對著螢幕和海面指指點點，一邊和旁邊的人說笑著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"在那一刻，正在發生的一切彷彿都是不真實的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"最後，那兩位女俠出現了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"她們的出現又將一切拉回了現實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"這真是......這真是太刺激了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"經紀人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以你想創作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，不愧是你，真瞭解我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"經紀人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我們認識了多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我要創作，我要將此時此刻的害怕、感激、迷茫都記錄下來，作成一首歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"這首歌為我自己而作，但與她們有關。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水月","speakerId":"avg_437_mizuki_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座城市雖然還挺好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水月","speakerId":"avg_437_mizuki_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊塔尼亞的歌劇，哥倫比亞的電影，還有玻利瓦爾的咖啡，之前想要體驗的東西都體驗到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水月","speakerId":"avg_437_mizuki_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這座城市裡的人還真是無聊，比賽過半就不想跟他們玩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水月","speakerId":"avg_437_mizuki_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是早知道最後會變成這樣，中途確認陳姐姐沒事後應該和她一起上船的，這樣應該能多幫上她的忙吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水月","speakerId":"avg_437_mizuki_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦，反正這座城市也差不多玩膩了，看一看陳姐姐她們會去哪裡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水月","speakerId":"avg_437_mizuki_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳姐姐來的地方，肯定也有許多和陳姐姐一樣的好人吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你太亂來了，詩懷雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯嗯，哦哦哦，好好好，知道了知道了，為什麼我非得被你教訓不可！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在近衛局可以說就是交在你的手裡，你卻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，我自己有數的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才是，明明是跑羅德島當幹員，結果卻偷偷跑這裡來度假！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這是......算了，你說得也沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接著吵啊，怎麼停了，老陳走了之後，你們上次吵架感覺都不知道是什麼時候的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我上次去羅德島的時候還是吵過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，總之，來都來了，事情也都解決了，我們還是把一些不愉快給忘掉，然後好好地玩一玩才是正經事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對吧，老陳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，還在想昨天的事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。呵，這可能是我這輩子收到的最不想要的榮譽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，確實，老實說，就算是我，也覺得夠噁心人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是它就是發生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老陳，世上可沒有那麼多兩全其美和稱心如意的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了行了，比起坐著聊天，不如出去購物吃大餐才能提起精神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走了，中午本小姐請客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那隻死老鼠去哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她好像一大早就出去了，但是不知道去哪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我大概知道，我去找她吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了記得告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，昨晚開始就躲著我，等我找到她，她死定了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我離開後，這裡就交給你打理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教給你的那些沒忘吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，您放一百個心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在聊什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是陳小姐，大姐頭正在給我們訓話呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別跟她扯這個，小心她逮捕你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經不是警察了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可沒見過你這麼多管閒事的遊客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先下去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賭場老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找我有什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，你應該不會是主動找我來喝酒的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我說是呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......喝一杯也可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的龍門青年創業者協會會長，是個雷厲風行，對自己和他人都很嚴格的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次，算是見識到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我知道的龍門近衛局特別督察組組長，是個鐵面無私，對罪犯毫不留情的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次，也算是領教了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次是魏彥吾讓你來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是文月夫人讓我代表魏長官來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一開始不理解，看到你就理解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不生氣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不生氣，這對我而言是個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鼠王的女兒未必是鼠王，但也可以是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你才幫他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不會告訴你答案的，陳暉潔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我和你不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想說我拋棄了龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一開始是有點這個意思，現在沒有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這只是陳述句，我和你不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽著還是刺耳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是你的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你找到死老鼠沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她就在旁邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們現在在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"26號沿海公路的一家酒吧裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"26號？那正好，我看到有家很不錯的店也在那裡，我把地址發給你，你們先過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"給我把那隻死老鼠也拖上，她別想跑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也聽到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，這個女人還是這麼麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙灘那邊的人真多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟這座城市的象徵之一，那艘遊輪就那麼沉了，總會有許多人好奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那艘遊輪......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你怎麼想，那艘遊輪是我們炸掉的，這是事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坎黛拉女士同意用我們的獎金來抵消已經是謝天謝地了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確切地說，是你炸的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有更好的方法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？那邊的是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃內斯托？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳小姐，林小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坎黛拉女士饒了父親以外的其他人一命，大部分人都被放逐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坎黛拉女士念在我這幾年的功勞上，允許我留下，當然，我的工作肯定是沒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算留下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我打算離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和拉菲艾拉在猶豫去哪裡，我從昨晚想到現在也想不出一個所以然，就在這裡看著海發呆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉菲艾拉是那個小姑娘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，她是父親戰友皮尤的女兒，皮尤叔叔為了把父親從監獄裡救出來而死，死前把她託付給了父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位有沒有考慮過現在把我就地解決掉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還沒有資格來審判你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你成功了，再讓我遇到你，我會殺了你。現在......就算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，真是有兩位風格的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......陳小姐，林小姐，用炎國的話來說，我這樣已經是大不孝了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然也有大義滅親的說法，不過你算不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，確實，我可沒有什麼大義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過至少，在這一次行動的過程中，我沒有想過背叛父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在船上對陳小姐你說的那些話，並不是謊言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道兩位這段時間在這裡生活有沒有這樣的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我清楚地知道這座城市建立在什麼之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，當我看到這些高樓大廈，這片碧波藍天的時候，我還是會不由自主地覺得它是對的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想不出除此以外的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但你選擇離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老實說，其實如果不是兩位的出現，我覺得我一定會從此甘願成為坎黛拉女士的手下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，陳小姐你對我說的那些話，又讓我產生了迷茫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位來自其他國家，說不定，在其他地方，有不同的方法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼，和兩位說完之後，感覺舒服了一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝兩位沒有見面就把我解決掉，還聽我說了這麼多廢話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"立場不同而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就不繼續打擾兩位了，我應該還會在這座城市停留一段時間，要是有用得到我的地方，請儘管找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我幫不了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也......你的意思是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是覺得讓他就這麼下去有些可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我會考慮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，老陳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們正好從市政府出來，詩小姐把我們也一起叫上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此。和市長談得如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沾了你們的光，我們也算是對這次事件有貢獻，市長想都沒想就同意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實是有那位的風格。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死老鼠，終於讓我抓到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又沒跑。反倒是你，你是不是腦子有病，詩懷雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才腦子有病！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一般人會因為嫉妒朋友出去玩而自己也跟上，而且到了地方還躲著對方的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本小姐樂意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，Missy說下午要一起去購物，順便買土產，老陳，林小姐，飯後一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死老鼠不准不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，反正我也沒什麼特別的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們先去吃飯吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四位，來，稍微擺一下pose。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忽然覺得這一幕很適合拍成照片，我來給你們拍一張，作為這次度假的紀念吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊好啊，喂，死老鼠，要拍照了，趕緊站好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我們四個聚在一起倒也確實是難得的機會，那就拍一張吧，老陳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，三，二，一，茄子——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"narration","text":"多索雷斯產的手磨咖啡都有一股獨特的香氣，而其中最上乘的那一種，香氣尤為濃郁。\n尚未入口時，只聞其香；入口時，只得其苦。但只消再等一會兒，就能真正品味到其中的美妙。\n苦而不澀，香而不膩，回味無窮。即使是最挑剔的批評家，也不能從中找出一點瑕疵。\n在萊塔尼亞的部分貴族們之間，甚至有這樣的攀比——誰能獲得多索雷斯產的絕品咖啡，誰就會在當地的社交圈擁有絕對的話語權。\n而這樣稀少的咖啡的其中一份，現在，正靜靜地在龍門總督魏彥吾手中的杯子裡冒著騰騰熱氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你在看雨霞寫的有關這次多索雷斯之行的報告？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"對。許久沒有見到坎黛拉，這個女人看來還是老樣子，瘋瘋癲癲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你敢說你和她不一樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我和她當然不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽派去的信使說，雨霞和小陳，這次好像做得很不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道為什麼詩懷雅家大小姐和星熊也去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"她們兩個確實做得很不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"但我想，她們自己不會很高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你說坎黛拉不會害她們，我同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"但坎黛拉這個女人的善意，我恐怕她們還不知道該怎麼去承受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"對這個女人來說，沒有大是大非，只有結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你還是拐彎抹角想說我一開始不該送小陳和雨霞過去是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不，恰好相反，你說得對，見一見，沒有壞處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲，難得你也會說些好話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"既然這樣，給你看個好東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞帶回來的一張照片。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"20_I05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看，年輕真好，一個個都有活力得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們也有過那樣的時光，你還記得吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我當然記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看到小陳過得好，我也就放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這張照片我要去裱起來，好好收藏起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你高興就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"彥吾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說，小陳還會回來嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彥吾"]},{"speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","aliases":["文月"]}]}
